OL,3,GNEWSAThree jailed for dealing cocaine
OL,4,Aand heroin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree members of an organised crime
OL,7,Fgang have been jailed for selling
OL,8,Fcocaine and heroin across Hull.
OL,10,FDavid Lyddon, Claire Broadbent and
OL,11,FReece Fullard were arrested after
OL,12,Fpolice began an investigation into a
OL,13,Fphone line believed to be linked to
OL,14,Fdrug dealing.
OL,16,FOfficers obtained CCTV footage which
OL,17,Fshowed the mobile being topped up by
OL,18,FLyddon, Humberside Police said.
OL,20,FAnalysis of calls and text messages
OL,21,Flinked Lyddon to other members of the
OL,22,Fgang.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
